---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../components/CodeBlock.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import { useCopy } from "../i18n/copy";
import { localizePath } from "../i18n/locale";

const { locale, t } = useCopy(Astro.url.pathname);

const runCmd = `cargo run --locked -p netbaiot-cli -- demo --once`;
const releaseDemo = `./netbaiot demo --once`;
const client = `use futures_util::StreamExt;
use netbaiot_client::NetbaIoTClient;
use netbaiot_protocol::EventFilter;

#[netbaiot_driver::main]
async fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let client = NetbaIoTClient::builder()
        .endpoint(std::env::var("NETBAIOT_ENDPOINT")?)
        .token(std::env::var("NETBAIOT_TOKEN")?)
        .event_token(std::env::var("NETBAIOT_EVENT_TOKEN")?)
        .event_address(std::env::var("NETBAIOT_EVENT_ADDRESS")?.parse()?)
        .connect().await?;
    let mut events = client.events().subscribe(EventFilter::default()).await?;
    while let Some(delivery) = events.next().await {
        let delivery = delivery?;
        println!("event {}", delivery.event_id());
        // Process the event durably and idempotently before ACK.
        delivery.ack().await?;
    }
    Ok(())
}`;
const production = `netbaiot init --production --domain example.com`;
const setup = `./netbaiot init my-gateway
cd my-gateway
../netbaiot config check --config netbaiot.json
../netbaiot serve`;

---

<BaseLayout title={t.iotStart.title} description={t.iotStart.description}>
  <div class="wrap content-page">
    <p class="kicker">{t.iotStart.kicker}</p>
    <h1 class="page-title" set:html={t.iotStart.heroHtml} />
    <p class="page-deck">
      {t.iotStart.deck.replace("{msrv}", site.iot.msrv).replace("{protocol}", site.iot.protocolVersion)}
    </p>

    <article class="card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3>{t.iotStart.outlineTitle}</h3>
      <ol class="howto">
        {t.iotStart.outline.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ol>
    </article>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{t.iotStart.runTitle}</h2>
      <p>{t.iotStart.runBody}</p>
    </div>
    <CodeBlock code={runCmd} lang="bash" />
    <p>{locale === "zh" ? "使用解压后的发布包时，运行：" : "From an extracted release archive, run:"}</p>
    <CodeBlock code={releaseDemo} lang="bash" />

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{t.iotStart.uploadTitle}</h2>
      <p>{t.iotStart.uploadBody}</p>
    </div>
    <CodeBlock code={setup} lang="bash" />

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{t.iotStart.clientTitle}</h2>
      <p>{t.iotStart.clientBody}</p>
    </div>
    <CodeBlock code={client} lang="rust" />
    <p>{locale === "zh" ? "示例依赖 futures-util、netbaiot-client、netbaiot-protocol 和 netbaiot-driver。事件地址与事件令牌必须与 Business RPC 监听及认证配置匹配；生产应用应先完成持久化等业务处理，再 ACK。" : "The example uses futures-util, netbaiot-client, netbaiot-protocol and netbaiot-driver. The event address and token must match the Business RPC listener and authentication configuration. Production applications should complete durable processing before ACK."}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{t.iotStart.deviceTitle}</h2>
      <p>{t.iotStart.deviceBody}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{t.iotStart.cliTitle}</h2>
      <p>{t.iotStart.cliBody}</p>
    </div>
    <CodeBlock code={production} lang="bash" />
    <div class="prose">
      {locale === "zh" ? (
        <><p>命令在当前目录生成 netbaiot.json、私有 CA 层级和独立的设备与管理 TLS 密钥。设备入口默认监听 0.0.0.0:8443，UDP 使用同一端口；非回环管理监听需要独立的 management_tls。Business RPC 使用 business_rpc.listen 和独立的 TLS 配置。</p>
        <p>初始化会显示一次新生成的离线 CA 口令；请安全保存，不要写入日志，也不要提供给运行中的网关。仅向相应客户端分发 root-ca.pem 信任锚，证书仍需通过域名校验。基础域名及其一级通配子域名会加入证书；其他域名或 IP 需显式配置。</p>
        <p>生成的认证和业务接收地址是本地默认值，部署前必须启动对应服务或修改配置。使用 netbaiot cert reload 更新运行中网关的证书；已有连接继续使用原配置，新握手使用新配置。</p></>
      ) : (
        <><p>The command creates netbaiot.json, a private CA hierarchy and independent device and management TLS keys in the current directory. Device ingress defaults to 0.0.0.0:8443; UDP uses the same port. Non-loopback management requires its own management_tls. Business RPC uses business_rpc.listen and an independent TLS profile.</p>
        <p>Initialization displays the new offline CA password once. Store it securely, keep it out of logs, and do not supply it to the running gateway. Distribute only root-ca.pem as the appropriate client trust anchor; certificate hostname validation still applies. Certificates cover the base domain and its one-level wildcard; configure additional domains or IPs explicitly.</p>
        <p>The generated authentication and business receiver addresses are local defaults. Start those services or change the configuration before deployment. Use netbaiot cert reload to update certificates on a running gateway; existing connections retain their old configuration and new handshakes use the new one.</p></>
      )}
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{t.iotStart.contractTitle}</h2>
      <ul>
        {t.iotStart.contract.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <h2>{t.iotStart.licenseTitle}</h2>
      <p>
        {t.iotStart.licenseBody.split("{license}")[0]}
        <a href={localizePath("/iot/license", locale)}>{site.iot.license}</a>
        {t.iotStart.licenseBody.split("{license}")[1]}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
